        # transitively, so the lazy import resolves at runtime. Do NOT re-add
        # (reintroduces the cycle) — if a runtime import genuinely fails, add the
        # dep to the *consumer/test* target, not to this utils library.
        # (Re-removed 2026-07-01: the edge had been re-added, recreating the
